rooms_desc ({"It's the hallway of Yahoo's house.You can see a small red desk and a comfortable chair.","You are standing in the Conference Room.There is a mahagony table in the middle of the room and manychairs around. You see a cocktail cabinet in the corner. Thereare some flowers on the table and a strange looking bookshelfto the east.","This is the Bedroom and nothing else.There is a big bed in the middle of the room.","You are entered into the Study Room.It is a simple room nothing in it except......Oh, it is a book lying on the floor!","You are walking in a long hallway.There is a small stone on the west wall.","This is the end of the long hallway.You see a door to the north and a bell.You also see a red note and a black doormat.Behind the door there is a strange lamp.","This is the private Consultation Room in the house.All the room is filled with a strange energy of the Pure White Magic.The room isn't very decorated but you feel the presence of something.Yahoo is standing in the middle of the flood of the One White Light.",0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Hallway","You are standing in the Conference Room.","Bedroom","Study Room","Hallway","End of the Hallway","Consultation Room",0,0,0,})
