items ({({"desk","A solid colored desk with a small book on it","book","This is the visitors' book, but unfortunately you can not use it","chair","You can sit down and relax",}),({"table","A solid mahagony table with some flowers on it","flowers","White and black colored flowers","chair","Big black chair with some runes","runes","You can not understand the runes","cabinet","A big cocktail cabinet, unfortunately it is closed","bookshelf","A simple shelf but maybe you can pass it","shelf","A simple shelf but maybe you can pass it",}),({"bed","A big big big bed. Yahoo likes sleeping.",}),({"book","It's a very used book titled \"E. Rich.: Artificial Intelligence\"",}),({"stone","You read: Mages! This room is waiting for your illusions!",}),({"door","A white wooden door with some runes and a bell on it","runes","You can't understand the whole sentence except one word: MAGE","bell","A bell but you can't push it 'cause Yahoo isn't a wizard","note","It says: USE THE DOORMAT BEFORE YOU ENTER","mat","A clean and useful mat","mat","A clean and useful doormat","lamp","A red lamp. Maybe you shouln't wait for the RED ALARM light",}),({"light","You've never seen such a strange light. This is the One and Only White Light","yahoo","Yahoo, the half-elven mage",}),0,0,0,})
